//complete cash payment
//assumes there is at least 1 item in the sale

Alias "Complete sale" 1758 740
Alias dialog 506 366
Alias top_button 552 173
Alias "Print least" 484 295

MouseClick "Complete sale"
Sleep 1000

;asks for Club+ card
Assert memo dialog "Club+ card If your customer has a Club+ card, choose cancel then scan their card"
ClickButton "formDlg" "No Card"
Sleep 100

ClickButton Payment OK ;this auto selects Cash
Sleep 100

MouseClick top_button
Sleep 100

MouseClick "Print least"
Sleep 500
